{"title":"Gold Enoki Mushroom","slug":"Gold_Enoki_Mushroom","pageid":3718,"revid":18822,"timestamp":"2025-07-09T00:47:15Z","lastEditor":"PilotPerson577","categories":[],"infobox":{"type":"Objects","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Snowlands"},{"label":"Shop","value":"N/A"},{"label":"Price","value":"Sell Price: $560 raw, $2,240 jammed"},{"label":"Function","value":"Sellable Fruit"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"Version 1.71.0"}]},"sections":[{"id":"overview","text":"Overview"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"overview\">Overview</h2>\n<p>The <b>Enoki Mushroom</b> can be found in the same cave as <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Sapphire/\">Sapphire</a> in the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Snowy_Peaks/\">Snowlands</a>. It sells for $560 raw and $1,400 in dye form. Due to its scarcity, it is recommended to collect in conjunction with <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Enoki_Mushroom/\">Enoki Mushrooms</a>.\n</p>"}
